{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765471,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"CODM ","festival_id":520986,"organization_id":825345,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-03T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-11-15T23:59:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/codm-scaler-school-of-technology-bengaluru-karnataka-1765471","region":"hybrid","details":"<p><strong>CODM CARNAGE 2.0 &mdash; RIFT OPS<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\"Breach the Rift. Rule the Verse.\"<\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong>Overview:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">CODM Carnage 2.0 (Rift Ops) is the competitive squad vs. squad multiplayer tournament for Yugaantar 2026 (Game Verse edition). Teams battle across Hardpoint, Search &amp; Destroy, and Control\/Domination in online qualifiers and offline arena finals.<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Format:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Multiplayer &ndash; Squad vs Squad<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Entry Fee:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Free<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Venue:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Online (Group Stage) &amp; Yugaantar Gaming Arena (Quarterfinals, Semifinals, Finals)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Prize Pool:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u20b96,000 total<\/span><\/li>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><strong>1st Place:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u20b93,000<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><strong>2nd Place:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u20b92,000<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><strong>3rd Place:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u20b91,000<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Team Composition:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">5 main players<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1 optional substitute (swappable only between matches with &ge;10 mins notice)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Match Format:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Group Stage (Online &mdash; BO1):<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Format:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Sudden Death; single decisive map\/mode announced per match day.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Map Veto:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Ban&ndash;Ban&ndash;Ban&ndash;Ban (remaining map is played).<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Seeding:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Standings determine seeding; the higher-placed team earns Veto Privilege for their Semifinal.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Quarterfinals (Offline &mdash; BO3):<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Fixed Mode Order:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Game 1: Hardpoint &rarr; Game 2: Search &amp; Destroy &rarr; Game 3: Control\/Domination.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Map Veto:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Ban&ndash;Ban&ndash;Pick&ndash;Pick&ndash;Ban&ndash;Ban (decider map remaining). First to 2 wins.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Semifinals (Offline &mdash; BO3):<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Mode Order:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Default is HP &rarr; S&amp;D &rarr; Control\/Domination.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Qualifier Veto Privilege:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Higher-placed team from Group Stage may reorder or swap one mode (must confirm 30 mins prior). First to 2 wins.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Finals (Offline &mdash; BO5 Pro Standard):<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Fixed Mode Order (No Veto):<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Game 1: Hardpoint &rarr; Game 2: S&amp;D &rarr; Game 3: Control\/Domination &rarr; Game 4: Hardpoint (new map) &rarr; Game 5: S&amp;D (new map).<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Map Veto:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Ban&ndash;Pick&ndash;Pick&ndash;Pick&ndash;Pick&ndash;Ban (decider map remaining). First to 3 wins.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Game Details &amp; Setup:<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>\n<p><strong>Parameter<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/th>\n<th>\n<p><strong>Specification<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Game Mode<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multiplayer only (no Battle Royale)<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Modes Played<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hardpoint, Search &amp; Destroy, Control\/Domination<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Perspective<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">TPP or FPP (fixed per stage &ge;48 hours in advance)<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Map Pool<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Announced &ge;48 hours in advance; follows official veto procedures<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Devices<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bring Your Own Device (BYOD) &mdash; bare mobile phone, charger, and headphones only<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Accounts<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Players must use their registered CODM IDs<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Online Connectivity<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Group Stage: Players are responsible for their own stable connection<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Offline Connectivity<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Playoffs\/Finals: Venue Wi-Fi provided; device issues are not grounds for a restart (only verified server crashes qualify)<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Hardware Restrictions<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Emulators, controllers, or external triggers are strictly prohibited<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Regulations:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Check-In:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Teams must report 30 minutes before match time; join the lobby within 10 minutes of invite.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Room Details:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Shared 5&ndash;15 minutes prior to match time.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Pauses:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Maximum 1 tactical pause per match (up to 5 minutes).<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Side Selection:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> BO1: Coin toss winner picks side; BO3\/BO5: Loser of the previous map picks side.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Overtime:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Sudden death on final point for Hardpoint; 1 sudden death round for Control\/Domination.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Recording:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Mandatory in offline stages (submit within 24 hours on request); recommended for online stages.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Disputes:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Must be raised within 10 minutes of match end with proof; referee decision is final within 30 minutes.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Judging Criteria:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Each map win = 1 point.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Series win = First team to win majority of maps (BO1: 1 win, BO3: 2 wins, BO5: 3 wins).<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Registration &amp; Eligibility:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Process:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Online link or offline coordinators.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Details Required:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Team name, player names, CODM IDs, contact numbers, ages.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Eligibility:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Valid government\/school ID required for offline verification.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Disqualification Criteria:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Using emulators, controllers, external triggers, or unauthorized software\/hacks.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Using banned weapons, attachments, perks, scorestreaks, or operator skills.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fielding unregistered\/ineligible players.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Teaming, match-fixing, or exploiting in-game glitches.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Toxic, abusive, or unsportsmanlike behavior.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Lateness Penalties:<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>\n<p><strong>Delay Duration<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/th>\n<th>\n<p><strong>Penalty Applied<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>0&ndash;5 minutes<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Warning<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>5&ndash;10 minutes<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Forfeit first map\/round<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>10&ndash;15 minutes<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Forfeit entire match<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>15+ minutes<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Full disqualification from tournament<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p><strong>Banned Items &amp; Practices:<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>\n<p><strong>Category<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/th>\n<th>\n<p><strong>Banned Items \/ Restrictions<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Weapons<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">NA-45, SKS, SVD, XPR, Thumper, Shorty, SMRS, FHJ-18, .50 GS, MW11, FSS Hurricane, Sten, M21 EBR, Striker, Echo, Jak-12<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Attachments<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Akimbo (all weapons), Thermite\/Incendiary ammo, RPD Cooling Compressor Barrel, HVK-30 Large Caliber ammo, and all bugged attachments<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Red Perks<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Persistence, Martyrdom, Pinpoint<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Green Perks<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Quick Fix, Restock, Tracker, Serpentine<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Blue Perks<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Alert, High Alert, Shrapnel, Hardline<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Lethal Equipment<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trip Mines, Thermite, Molotov, C4, Contact Grenades, Drill Charges <\/span><em><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">(Only Frag and Sticky Grenades allowed)<\/span><\/em><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Tactical Equipment<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Heartbeat Sensor, Trip Sensor, Gas Grenades, Flash Drones, Cryo Bombs<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Operator Skills<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">K9 Unit, Kinetic Armor, TAK-5, Ballista EM3, Reactor Core, Transform Shield, Hive <\/span><em><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">(No duplicate skills allowed per team)<\/span><\/em><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Scorestreaks<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">VTOL, Swarm, Stealth Chopper, Shock RC, Goliath, Napalm, Orbital Laser, Advanced UAV, Counter-UAV<\/span><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p><strong>Registration Details :&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Unstop Link : <\/span><strong>TBD<\/strong><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Deadline : 15 November 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>","overall_prizes":"Total Prize Pool: \u20b96,000  - 1st: \u20b93,000 | 2nd: \u20b92,000 | 3rd: \u20b91,000","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":28043294,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-03T23:16:23+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-04T21:43:38+05:30","co